      "updated": 1795726007072,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every org-scoped table has orgId -> Organization (cascade); API scopes it with forOrganization(orgId).\nSoft delete: _deleted + purge_at on folders, collections, songs, services, agenda_events (replicated, idx orgId+updatedAt+id).\nNot replicated: service_notes, annotations (REST + Firestore), notifications, AI, auth/org/billing.\nOmitted on purpose: MCP / OAuth provider tables (jwks, oauth*), verification, notificationDelivery (audit log).",
      "originalText": "Every org-scoped table has orgId -> Organization (cascade); API scopes it with forOrganization(orgId).\nSoft delete: _deleted + purge_at on folders, collections, songs, services, agenda_events (replicated, idx orgId+updatedAt+id).\nNot replicated: service_notes, annotations (REST + Firestore), notifications, AI, auth/org/billing.\nOmitted on purpose: MCP / OAuth provider tables (jwks, oauth*), verification, notificationDelivery (audit log).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aF"
    },
